                        <p class="mt-5 text-base md:text-lg font-semibold text-white/90 leading-snug">Run it again. See what changed underneath.</p>
                        <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-sm text-white/70 uppercase tracking-[0.12em]">A recorded run, replayed against what would happen today.</p>
                        <p class="mt-8 text-lg text-white/55 leading-relaxed">
                            A model swapped under the same name does not announce itself. Same prompt, same agent, different answer, and the first anyone hears about it is a complaint six weeks later. Replaying a recorded run against the present turns that into a difference you can point at. <span class="text-white/35">Coming soon. It needs the tool responses held next to the calls, which is the field it is still waiting on.</span>
